1. WhatsApp – Chat Messages

Messages are stored locally on your phone,so you can read previous conversations even without internet. 
New messages can be sent when the connection returns.

2. Spotify – Downloaded Songs

Downloaded songs are stored locally on the device, allowing you to listen without an internet connection.

3. Zomato – Recent Data

Some recently viewed restaurant information can be cached locally, allowing parts of the app to load faster or 
remain useful during temporary connectivity problems.
